hotspot-share (2.0.5-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Resolved WebKitGTK Wayland blank frame by allowing hardware acceleration on demand.
  * Added WEBKIT_DISABLE_SANDBOX_THIS_IS_DANGEROUS to bypass nested bubblewrap deadlock in Snap.
  * Hardened security: remote file deletion blocked by default unless explicitly configured.
  * Added comprehensive SECURITY.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, and CodeQL security scanning.
  * Redesigned documentation with outcome-driven positioning, comparison tables, and compatibility matrix.

